 "category": "geology",
 "category_zh": "地质奇观",
 "category_en": "Geological wonder",
 "intro_zh": "景区以丹霞奇峰为主要特色，由三爿石、十八曲、塔峰、须女湖、仙居寺等部分组成。江郎山以雄伟奇特的“三爿石”著称于世，拥有伟人峰、郎峰天游、开明禅寺、江郎书院等景点景观。廿八都在历史上是边区的重要集镇，素有“枫溪锁钥”之称。",
 "intro_en": "The scenic spot is mainly characterized by Danxia Qifeng, which is composed of Sanyi Stone, Shibaqu, Tower Peak, Xunv Lake, Xianju Temple and other parts. Jianglang Mountain is famous for its majestic and unique \"Three Pillars\" and has scenic spots such as Great Man Peak, Langfeng Tianyou, Kaiming Zen Temple, and Jianglang Academy. Nianbadu was historically an important market town in the border area and was known as the \"Key to Maple Creek\".",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
